- [Banks](https://www.fitchratings.com/banks): Credit ratings, research, and analysis for the global banking sector covering issuer default ratings, viability ratings, government support ratings, and derivative counterparty ratings.
- [Non-Bank Financial Institutions](https://www.fitchratings.com/non-bank-financial-institutions): Credit ratings, research, and analysis for non-bank financial institutions including finance companies, securities firms, investment holding companies, and financial market infrastructure.
- [Insurance](https://www.fitchratings.com/insurance): Credit ratings, Insurer Financial Strength Ratings, research, and analysis for the global insurance sector including life, non-life, reinsurance, and takaful.
- [Fund & Asset Managers](https://www.fitchratings.com/fund-asset-managers): Credit ratings and research for global fund and asset management firms, including money market funds, bond funds, and alternative investment managers.

