## Sectors – Structured Finance

- [ABS](https://www.fitchratings.com/structured-finance/abs): Ratings and research for the global asset-backed securities market with proprietary ABS indices tracking auto, credit card, equipment, marketplace lending, student loan, and timeshare sectors.
