## Topics – Thematic Research

- [Bubble Risk](https://www.fitchratings.com/topics/bubble-risk): Research on asset bubble risks across global credit markets, assessing where valuations, leverage, and market behavior signal elevated risk of correction.
- [Climate Change](https://www.fitchratings.com/topics/climate-change): Research on how climate change, transition risks, and physical risks affect credit profiles across sovereigns, corporates, financial institutions, and structured finance.
- [Commercial Real Estate](https://www.fitchratings.com/topics/commercial-real-estate): Cross-sector research on CRE credit risks covering office, retail, industrial, multifamily, and hospitality markets and implications for CMBS, banks, and corporates.
- [Commodities](https://www.fitchratings.com/topics/commodities): Research on how commodity price movements and supply-demand dynamics affect credit profiles across energy, mining, chemicals, and agricultural sectors.
- [Cyber Risk](https://www.fitchratings.com/topics/cyber-risk): Research on how cybersecurity threats affect credit profiles across financial institutions, corporates, sovereigns, and infrastructure.
- [Data Center & Digital Infrastructure](https://www.fitchratings.com/topics/data-center-and-digital-infrastructure): Research on credit implications of global data center expansion, digital infrastructure investment, AI-driven demand, and connectivity infrastructure.
- [Digital Assets & Cyber Security](https://www.fitchratings.com/topics/cryptocurrency): Research on how digital assets, cryptocurrencies, blockchain technology, and cybersecurity developments affect credit profiles.
- [Financial Regulation](https://www.fitchratings.com/topics/financial-regulation): Research on how regulatory changes, capital requirements, and financial policy developments affect credit profiles across banks, insurance, NBFIs, and structured finance.
- [Geopolitics & Elections](https://www.fitchratings.com/topics/geopolitics-elections): Research on how geopolitical developments, trade tensions, sanctions, elections, and political instability affect credit profiles.
- [Inflation & Rates](https://www.fitchratings.com/topics/rate-cycle): Research on how inflation trends, central bank monetary policy, and interest rate cycles affect credit profiles across all sectors.
- [Credit Outlooks](https://www.fitchratings.com/topics/outlooks): Forward-looking credit outlooks across all major sectors and regions, providing views on expected rating trends and credit conditions.
- [U.S. Policy](https://www.fitchratings.com/topics/us-policy): Research on how U.S. government policy, fiscal decisions, trade actions, tariffs, and regulatory changes affect credit profiles.
- [Emerging Markets](https://www.fitchratings.com/topics/emerging-markets): Credit ratings, research, and analysis for emerging markets globally across sovereigns, corporates, financial institutions, and structured finance.
- [Frontier Markets](https://www.fitchratings.com/topics/frontier-markets): Credit ratings, research, and analysis for frontier markets covering smaller or less-developed economies with emerging credit profiles.

